            "learn": {
                "paragraphs": [
                    "**Axioms** are universal truths used in all branches of math (not just geometry).",
                    "**1. Equality:** Things equal to the same thing are equal to each other.",
                    "**2. Addition:** If equals are added to equals, the wholes are equal.",
                    "**3. Subtraction:** If equals are subtracted from equals, remainders are equal.",
                    "**4. Coincide:** Things which coincide with one another are equal.",
                    "**5. Whole/Part:** The whole is greater than the part.",
                    "**6. Doubles:** Doubles of the same things are equal.",
                    "**7. Halves:** Halves of the same things are equal."
                ],
                "formulas": [
